BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.6 Tm 11.2 TL /F1 8.8 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The original blog-sourced data is not available, so we rebuilt it from public play-by-play data \() Tj /F3 8.8 Tf (sportsdataverse/cfbfastR-data) Tj /F1 8.8 Tf (,) Tj T* (GitHub\): 16 seasons \(2005-2020\), ~12.6k games, ~25k team-games, aggregated from ~2M plays. We keep ) Tj /F2 8.8 Tf (566) Tj T* (bowl/postseason games) Tj /F1 8.8 Tf (, of which 545 have two teams with ) Tj /F4 8.8 Tf 11.2 TL (\263) Tj /F1 8.8 Tf 11.2 TL (8 regular-season games. Per team-season we compute 28) Tj T* (features from ) Tj /F2 8.8 Tf (regular-season games only) Tj /F1 8.8 Tf ( \(no leakage\): scoring \(PPG, PAPG\), offensive and defensive yards/carry and) Tj T* (yards/attempt, completion, sack and interception rates, EPA/play, success rate, havoc rate, turnover margin, penalties, punt) Tj T* (average, FG%, and an end-of-season margin-aware ) Tj /F2 8.8 Tf (Elo rating) Tj /F1 8.8 Tf ( \(K=20, home edge 55, 1/3 regression to the mean each year\).) Tj T* (A game is the difference of the two teams' features; the label is the score margin.) Tj T* ET
